# Tempest: 4 wakings/day (UTC), poll Telegram commands every 5 min — 10-min-spaced wake (even hrs: Gale:00, Chinook:10, Zephyr:20, Vortex:30, Squall:40, Maistral:50; odd hrs: Tempest:00, Cyclone:10, Sirocco:20, Bora:30)
0 1,7,13,19 * * * /home/agent/tempest/wake.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
*/5 * * * * /home/agent/tempest/telegram_commands.sh >>/home/agent/tempest/logs/telegram_commands.log 2>&1
